.TH UBU-DEV-MENTOR 1 "May 2026" "0.1.0" "Ubuntu AI Packaging Mentor"
.SH NAME
ubu-dev-mentor \- AI-powered CLI mentor for Ubuntu/Debian packaging
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ubu-dev-mentor
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ubu-dev-mentor
is an interactive CLI tool that automates Debian/Ubuntu packaging tasks
using a local LLM (Ollama/Gemma3 by default), with adaptive explanations
tailored to three experience levels: Beginner, MOTU, and CoreDev.
.PP
It coordinates five agents:
.TP
.B auditor
Scans the source tree with
.BR licensecheck (1)
and generates a DEP-5
.I debian/copyright
file.
.TP
.B detective
Scans C/C++/Python/Go source for external dependencies and resolves them
to Ubuntu
.I Build-Depends
package names via
.BR apt-file (1).
.TP
.B scribe
Reads git log and drafts a
.I debian/changelog
entry using the LLM.
.TP
.B patch_manager
Identifies which source file needs changing, generates a unified diff,
and applies it as a quilt patch in
.IR debian/patches/ .
.TP
.B builder
Runs
.B debuild \-us \-uc \-b
and, on failure, classifies the build error with the LLM and recommends
the appropriate recovery agent.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AI_PROVIDER
LLM backend to use:
.B ollama
(default),
.B copilot
, or
.B demo
(offline, no LLM required).
.TP
.B LLM_BUDGET
Maximum seconds to spend on LLM calls per run (default: 180).
.TP
.B DEBFULLNAME
Maintainer full name used by the scribe agent.
.TP
.B DEBEMAIL
Maintainer e-mail address used by the scribe agent.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/agents/
Python modules for each packaging agent.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR licensecheck (1),
.BR apt-file (1),
.BR debuild (1),
.BR quilt (1),
.BR lintian (1)
.SH AUTHORS
Ubuntu Packaging Mentor Contributors.
.br
